---
import BaseLayout from "../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout title="Committee Admin">
  <section class="mx-auto max-w-2xl px-5 py-20 text-center">
    <h1 class="font-display text-2xl font-semibold text-ink-900">Committee Admin</h1>
    <p class="mt-4 text-ink-600">
      The Excel upload → publish tool isn't wired up yet — it's next on the build plan (see
      <code class="rounded bg-ink-100 px-1.5 py-0.5 text-sm">.plan/04-admin-cms.md</code>).
      Until then, new batches can be added by running the migration script or editing the
      JSON files under <code class="rounded bg-ink-100 px-1.5 py-0.5 text-sm">src/data/batches/</code> directly.
    </p>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
